  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This PIP aims to strengthen the rule of law in Egypt to promote economic growth and social stability. With Egypts low ranking in the 2023 Rule of Law Index, the project focuses on improving judicial efficiency and accessibility, essential for a better business climate and fair competition.</narrative>
